<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>AI Weekly Intelligence · {{ week_label }}</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto;
         padding: 2rem 1.5rem; color: #1a1a2e; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 16px; }
  .header { border-bottom: 3px solid #1a1a2e; padding-bottom: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .header-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; }
  .brand { font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #555; }
  .date  { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #555; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 0.25rem; }
  .tagline { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #666; }
  .exec-summary { background: #f0f4ff; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
                  margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; }
  .exec-summary h2 { font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
                     color: #2563eb; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .section { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .section-header { font-size: 0.7rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
                    color: #888; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  .item { margin-bottom: 2rem; padding-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px dashed #e5e7eb; }
  .item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .item-headline { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #111; }
  .item-body { font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .item-body p { margin: 0.5rem 0; }
  .item-body .label { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;
                      letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #2563eb; }
  .source-link { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #2563eb; word-break: break-all; }
  .signal-noise { background: #fefce8; border: 1px solid #fde68a; border-radius: 6px;
                  padding: 1rem 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .signal-noise h2 { font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
                     color: #b45309; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .footer { margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            font-size: 0.75rem; color: #aaa; text-align: center; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
  <div class="header-top">
    <span class="brand">AI Intelligence · Port Operations</span>
    <span class="date">{{ week_label }}</span>
  </div>
  <h1>Weekly AI Briefing</h1>
  <p class="tagline">Curated signal for the CFO — Foundation Models · Physical AI · Finance AI · AI Agents</p>
</div>

{{ body_html }}

<div class="footer">
  Generated by the weekly AI news system · {{ week_label }} · For internal use only
</div>

</body>
</html>
